---
import Base from "~/layouts/Base.astro";
import Header from "~/components/landing/Header.astro";
import Footer from "~/components/landing/Footer.astro";
---

<Base
	title="About — Modfolio Axiom"
	description="Applied Science & Engineering. Axiom의 미션, 비전, 그리고 생태계."
>
	<Header />
	<main id="main">
		<section class="about-hero">
			<span class="about-hero__label">About</span>
			<h1 class="about-hero__title">Modfolio Axiom</h1>
			<p class="about-hero__subtitle">Applied Science & Engineering</p>
		</section>

		<section class="about-mission">
			<div class="about-mission__inner">
				<span class="section-label">Mission</span>
				<div class="about-mission__content">
					<h2 class="about-mission__heading">
						Where precision meets discovery
					</h2>
					<div class="about-mission__text">
						<p>
							Axiom은 정밀함과 발견이 만나는 지점에서 기술의 새로운
							가능성을 탐구합니다. 엔지니어링, 과학, 의학, 연구의
							경계를 넘나드는 응용 기술을 개발하고, 이를 실제
							제품으로 구현하는 것이 우리의 미션입니다.
						</p>
						<p>
							100% Cloudflare Edge Native 아키텍처 위에서 구축된
							인프라는 전 세계 어디서든 동일한 성능과 안정성을
							보장합니다. House of Brands 원칙에 따라 각 자회사
							앱은 독립적인 디자인 시스템과 기술 스택을 유지하면서,
							SSO와 데이터 스키마를 통해 유기적으로 연결됩니다.
						</p>
						<p>
							Axiom이 추구하는 것은 단순한 소프트웨어 개발이
							아닙니다. 과학적 방법론에 기반한 체계적 접근, 엣지
							컴퓨팅의 한계를 탐구하는 기술적 도전, 그리고 이
							모든 것을 실제 사용자 가치로 전환하는 응용
							혁신입니다.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="about-subsidiary">
			<div class="about-subsidiary__inner">
				<span class="section-label">Subsidiary Apps</span>
				<div class="about-subsidiary__grid">
					<a
						href="https://amberstella.com"
						class="subsidiary-card"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noopener"
					>
						<div class="subsidiary-card__header">
							<h3 class="subsidiary-card__name">Amberstella</h3>
							<span class="badge badge--active">Active</span>
						</div>
						<p class="subsidiary-card__desc">
							실시간 셔틀/모빌리티 앱. Durable Objects +
							WebSocket 기반 라이브 위치 추적과 탑승 관리
							시스템.
						</p>
						<div class="subsidiary-card__stack">
							<span class="badge badge--indigo">SvelteKit 5</span>
							<span class="badge badge--indigo">D1</span>
							<span class="badge badge--indigo"
								>Durable Objects</span
							>
						</div>
					</a>
				</div>
				<p class="about-subsidiary__note">
					Axiom 그룹은 기술/모빌리티 영역의 자회사 앱을 지속적으로
					확장하고 있습니다.
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="about-ecosystem">
			<div class="about-ecosystem__inner">
				<span class="section-label">Modfolio Universe</span>
				<div class="about-ecosystem__content">
					<h2 class="about-ecosystem__heading">
						Part of something larger
					</h2>
					<p class="about-ecosystem__desc">
						Axiom은 Modfolio Universe 생태계의 기술/모빌리티 그룹
						포탈입니다. 15개 이상의 독립 앱으로 구성된 생태계 안에서
						각 그룹은 고유한 영역을 담당합니다.
					</p>
					<div class="about-ecosystem__grid">
						<a
							href="https://works.modfolio.io"
							class="ecosystem-card"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener"
						>
							<h3 class="ecosystem-card__name">
								Modfolio Works
							</h3>
							<p class="ecosystem-card__desc">
								교육/HR 그룹. 학원 CRM, AI 학습 도구.
							</p>
						</a>
						<a
							href="https://ls.modfolio.io"
							class="ecosystem-card"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener"
						>
							<h3 class="ecosystem-card__name">Modfolio LS</h3>
							<p class="ecosystem-card__desc">
								라이프스타일 그룹. 여행, 자기 관리 도구.
							</p>
						</a>
						<a
							href="https://studio.modfolio.io"
							class="ecosystem-card"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener"
						>
							<h3 class="ecosystem-card__name">
								Modfolio Studio
							</h3>
							<p class="ecosystem-card__desc">
								미디어/유틸리티 그룹. 문서, 오디오 변환.
							</p>
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="about-cta">
			<h2 class="about-cta__heading">Explore Axiom Portal</h2>
			<a href="https://nexus.modfolio.io" class="btn btn--primary btn--lg"
				>Enter Portal</a
			>
		</section>
	</main>
	<Footer />
</Base>

<style>
	/* ── Hero ── */
	.about-hero {
		min-height: 60vh;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		text-align: center;
		padding-top: 80px;
		padding-inline: clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2rem);
	}

	.about-hero__label {
		font-family: var(--font-code);
		font-size: var(--text-sm);
		color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
		letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide);
		text-transform: uppercase;
		margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
	}

	.about-hero__title {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: var(--text-4xl);
		font-weight: 700;
		line-height: var(--leading-tight);
		letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tight);
		background: var(--accent-gradient-text);
		-webkit-background-clip: text;
		-webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
		background-clip: text;
		margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
	}

	.about-hero__subtitle {
		font-family: var(--font-code);
		font-size: var(--text-lg);
		color: var(--color-text-accent);
		letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label);
	}

	/* ── Mission ── */
	.about-mission {
		padding-block: var(--space-12);
		padding-inline: clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2rem);
		position: relative;
	}

	.about-mission::before {
		content: "";
		position: absolute;
		top: 0;
		left: 0;
		right: 0;
		height: 1px;
		background: linear-gradient(
			90deg,
			transparent,
			var(--color-border-default) 20%,
			var(--color-border-accent) 50%,
			var(--color-border-default) 80%,
			transparent
		);
	}

	.about-mission__inner {
		max-width: var(--content-max-width);
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.about-mission__heading {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: var(--text-2xl);
		font-weight: 700;
		line-height: var(--leading-snug);
		letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tight);
		color: var(--color-text-primary);
		margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
	}

	.about-mission__text {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: var(--space-5);
		max-width: var(--measure);
	}

	.about-mission__text p {
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-size: var(--text-lg);
		color: var(--color-text-secondary);
		line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
	}

	/* ── Subsidiary ── */
	.about-subsidiary {
		padding-block: var(--space-12);
		padding-inline: clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2rem);
		position: relative;
	}

	.about-subsidiary::before {
		content: "";
		position: absolute;
		top: 0;
		left: 0;
		right: 0;
		height: 1px;
		background: linear-gradient(
			90deg,
			transparent,
			var(--color-border-default) 20%,
			var(--color-border-accent) 50%,
			var(--color-border-default) 80%,
			transparent
		);
	}

	.about-subsidiary__inner {
		max-width: var(--content-max-width);
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.about-subsidiary__grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(320px, 1fr));
		gap: var(--space-5);
		margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
	}

	.subsidiary-card {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: var(--space-4);
		background: var(--card-bg);
		border: var(--card-border);
		border-radius: var(--card-radius);
		padding: var(--card-padding);
		text-decoration: none;
		transition:
			border-color var(--dur-base) var(--ease-out),
			box-shadow var(--dur-base) var(--ease-out),
			transform var(--dur-base) var(--ease-out);
	}

	.subsidiary-card:hover {
		border-color: var(--color-border-accent);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-glow);
		background: var(--color-surface-2);
		transform: translateY(-2px);
	}

	.subsidiary-card__header {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
	}

	.subsidiary-card__name {
		font-family: var(--font-ui);
		font-size: var(--text-xl);
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--color-text-primary);
	}

	.subsidiary-card__desc {
		font-family: var(--font-ui);
		font-size: var(--text-sm);
		color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
		line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
	}

	.subsidiary-card__stack {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: var(--space-2);
	}

	.about-subsidiary__note {
		font-family: var(--font-ui);
		font-size: var(--text-sm);
		color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
		font-style: italic;
	}

	/* ── Ecosystem ── */
	.about-ecosystem {
		padding-block: var(--space-12);
		padding-inline: clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2rem);
		position: relative;
	}

	.about-ecosystem::before {
		content: "";
		position: absolute;
		top: 0;
		left: 0;
		right: 0;
		height: 1px;
		background: linear-gradient(
			90deg,
			transparent,
			var(--color-border-default) 20%,
			var(--color-border-accent) 50%,
			var(--color-border-default) 80%,
			transparent
		);
	}

	.about-ecosystem__inner {
		max-width: var(--content-max-width);
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.about-ecosystem__heading {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: var(--text-2xl);
		font-weight: 700;
		line-height: var(--leading-snug);
		letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tight);
		color: var(--color-text-primary);
		margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
	}

	.about-ecosystem__desc {
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-size: var(--text-lg);
		color: var(--color-text-secondary);
		line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
		max-width: var(--measure);
		margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
	}

	.about-ecosystem__grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		gap: var(--space-5);
	}

	.ecosystem-card {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: var(--space-3);
		background: var(--card-bg);
		border: var(--card-border);
		border-radius: var(--card-radius);
		padding: var(--card-padding);
		text-decoration: none;
		transition:
			border-color var(--dur-base) var(--ease-out),
			box-shadow var(--dur-base) var(--ease-out),
			transform var(--dur-base) var(--ease-out);
	}

	.ecosystem-card:hover {
		border-color: var(--color-border-accent);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-glow);
		background: var(--color-surface-2);
		transform: translateY(-2px);
	}

	.ecosystem-card__name {
		font-family: var(--font-ui);
		font-size: var(--text-lg);
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--color-text-primary);
	}

	.ecosystem-card__desc {
		font-family: var(--font-ui);
		font-size: var(--text-sm);
		color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
		line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
	}

	/* ── CTA ── */
	.about-cta {
		text-align: center;
		padding-block: var(--space-12);
		padding-inline: clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2rem);
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		gap: var(--space-8);
		position: relative;
	}

	.about-cta::before {
		content: "";
		position: absolute;
		top: 0;
		left: 0;
		right: 0;
		height: 1px;
		background: linear-gradient(
			90deg,
			transparent,
			var(--color-border-default) 20%,
			var(--color-border-accent) 50%,
			var(--color-border-default) 80%,
			transparent
		);
	}

	.about-cta__heading {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: var(--text-3xl);
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--color-text-primary);
	}

	/* ── Responsive ── */
	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.about-ecosystem__grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		.about-hero {
			min-height: 50vh;
		}
	}
</style>
